# Storyblok

> Storyblok is a headless content management system (CMS) designed to empower both developers and marketers by combining an API-first approach with a visual editor for seamless content creation and management. It offers scalable, flexible, and enterprise-grade solutions to build, manage, and deliver content across multiple channels efficiently. Trusted by global brands, Storyblok facilitates collaboration, integration, and innovation in modern web development and content workflows.

